stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ImageCheck: sandbox job requested

    ImageCheck --> Building: image not found
    ImageCheck --> Creating: image exists
    Building --> Creating: build success
    Building --> Failed: build error

    Creating --> Starting: container created
    Creating --> Failed: create error

    Starting --> Running: container started
    Starting --> Failed: start error

    Running --> Stopping: user stop / job complete
    Running --> Expired: TTL timeout
    Running --> Failed: container crash

    Stopping --> Removed: auto-remove
    Expired --> Removed: force remove
    Failed --> Removed: cleanup

    Removed --> [*]

    note right of Running
        output.log written to
        shared volume mount
    end note

    note right of Failed
        Preserve output.log
        for debugging
    end note
